# UI Core (Sanitized)

A condensed description of the primary UI framework suitable for public distribution.

## Overview
- Establishes the modular overlay renderer and shared input handling patterns.
- Coordinates layout loading and scaling using virtual grid units.
- Supports extensible HUD components while keeping sensitive telemetry overlays private.

## Sanitized Notes
- Detailed overlay inventories, debug panels, and command bindings have been redacted.
- Internal migration notes about legacy systems are preserved only in the secure repository.
- Refer to private engineering docs for widget APIs and performance instrumentation.
